  "explanation": {
    "text": "Dividing means sharing a number into equal groups. Division is the opposite of multiplication.",
    "example": "12 ÷ 3 asks: if we share 12 things into 3 equal groups, how many are in each group? The answer is 4, because 3 x 4 = 12."
